{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911490/extras/86c5d0d4ae49fcdd2b0ebab14931e89c.avif?t=1772300474\" width=800 height=102 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A turn-based fusion of deckbuilding and tactical combat. Shape your runes into deadly formations, chain devastating combos, and fight your way through an ancient dungeon to confront the dark power lurking below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911490/extras/4e78cbedec59242ce377b88440ee4ddf.avif?t=1772300474\" width=650 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play, swap, and shift your runes to chain powerful match-3 combos, with a persistent grid that lets you plan not just this turn, but the ones to come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911490/extras/9ec8583971e8eb09fbdab33edbd07ded.poster.avif?t=1772300474\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911490/extras/9ec8583971e8eb09fbdab33edbd07ded.webm?t=1772300474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911490/extras/9ec8583971e8eb09fbdab33edbd07ded.mp4?t=1772300474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911490/extras/7d24a53b9ab721e8b87f1e13635abda6.avif?t=1772300474\" width=650 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain your runes with intent to carve through enemies.\u00a0As you push deeper into the dungeon, each fight tests your strategy and skill against enemies that grow darker and more warped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911490/extras/2035318caa23bf23355cfb5eb2bc23f5.poster.avif?t=1772300474\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911490/extras/2035318caa23bf23355cfb5eb2bc23f5.webm?t=1772300474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911490/extras/2035318caa23bf23355cfb5eb2bc23f5.mp4?t=1772300474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911490/extras/03bba8769cd588ffeb100a458680499b.avif?t=1772300474\" width=650 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swiftly tune your deck before each battle. Run lean with a match-focused build, or adjust to a larger deck for powerful bonuses. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911490/extras/f8843fb04438bee37458450bd3ce9b81.poster.avif?t=1772300474\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911490/extras/f8843fb04438bee37458450bd3ce9b81.webm?t=1772300474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911490/extras/f8843fb04438bee37458450bd3ce9b81.mp4?t=1772300474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911490/extras/c3bbe2b2dd2f1748057677a85993e997.avif?t=1772300474\" width=650 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your journey by empowering and duplicating your runes.\u00a0Discover treasures and talismans in a world where every run is unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911490/extras/912952d4ff65a846aaf0867115592576.poster.avif?t=1772300474\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911490/extras/912952d4ff65a846aaf0867115592576.webm?t=1772300474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911490/extras/912952d4ff65a846aaf0867115592576.mp4?t=1772300474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911490/extras/fad18e51ef2eb9a755e53c6ae9b90c86.avif?t=1772300474\" width=650 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your heroes and unlock permanent abilities to strengthen future runs, while dungeons scale in difficulty to challenge both novices and veterans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:/